    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n19042" root="سحب" body-key="s">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">أُسْحُوبٌ</span></b>  (tropical:)  A man <i>who eats and drinks much,</i>
(S, A,) or <i>vehemently:</i> (K:) Az says that the
word known to him in the former sense is
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">أُسْحُوتٌ</span>, with <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">ت</span>; but that perhaps <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">اسحوب</span> is
allowable. (L, TA.)

